    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "按照字面上的意思，就是“鸡皮上的小疙瘩”。",
      "traditional": "按照字面上的意思，就是“雞皮上的小疙瘩”。",
      "pinyin": "àn zhào zì miàn shang de yì si jiù shì jī pí shang de xiǎo gē da",
      "english": "What are “chicken skin bumps”?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "那怎么用在人的身上呢？",
      "traditional": "那怎麼用在人的身上呢？",
      "pinyin": "nà zěn me yòng zài rén de shēn shang ne",
      "english": "The meaning of the characters is “small lumps on the chicken’s skin”."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "那是因为我们在受冷或者受到惊吓时，皮肤上会起一些小疙瘩。",
      "traditional": "那是因為我們在受冷或者受到驚嚇時，皮膚上會起一些小疙瘩。",
      "pinyin": "nà shì yīn wèi wǒ men zài shòu lěng huò zhě shòu dào jīng xià shí pí fū shang huì qǐ yì xiē xiǎo gē da",
      "english": "So how come it is used for a person’s body?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "而这些小疙瘩和去掉毛后的鸡皮相似，所以叫“鸡皮疙瘩”。",
      "traditional": "而這些小疙瘩和去掉毛後的雞皮相似，所以叫“雞皮疙瘩”。",
      "pinyin": "ér zhè xiē xiǎo gē da hé qù diào máo hòu de jī pí xiāng sì suǒ yǐ jiào jī pí gē da",
      "english": "That’s because when we are cold or frightened, we get small lumps on our skin."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "And these small lumps are similar to those of a plucked chicken's skin, so they’re called “chicken skin lumps”."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "“鸡皮疙瘩”可以用在很多种场合。",
      "traditional": "“雞皮疙瘩”可以用在很多種場合。",
      "pinyin": "jī pí gē da kě yǐ yòng zài hěn duō zhǒng chǎng hé",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "天冷时，你可以说“天太冷了，冷得我都起鸡皮疙瘩了”；",
      "traditional": "天冷時，你可以說“天太冷了，冷得我都起雞皮疙瘩了”；",
      "pinyin": "tiān lěng shí nǐ kě yǐ shuō tiān tài lěng le lěng de wǒ dōu qǐ jī pí gē da le",
      "english": "The word “chicken skin bumps” can be used on a lot of occasions."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "看了恐怖片，你可以说“这部电影吓得我直起鸡皮疙瘩”；",
      "traditional": "看了恐怖片，你可以說“這部電影嚇得我直起雞皮疙瘩”；",
      "pinyin": "kàn le kǒng bù piàn nǐ kě yǐ shuō zhè bù diàn yǐng xià de wǒ zhí qǐ jī pí gē da",
      "english": "When the weather is cold, you can say: “The weather is so cold it’s giving me goose bumps.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "听到别人的歌声，你可以说“她的歌声让我浑身都起了鸡皮疙瘩”；",
      "traditional": "聽到別人的歌聲，你可以說“她的歌聲讓我渾身都起了雞皮疙瘩”；",
      "pinyin": "tīng dào bié ren de gē shēng nǐ kě yǐ shuō tā de gē shēng ràng wǒ hún shēn dōu qǐ le jī pí gē da",
      "english": "When watching a horror movie, you can say: “This movie scares me so much that I get goose bumps.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "看到秀恩爱的情侣，你也可以说“你俩太肉麻了，我都起鸡皮疙瘩了”……",
      "traditional": "看到秀恩愛的情侶，你也可以說“你倆太肉麻了，我都起雞皮疙瘩了”……",
      "pinyin": "kàn dào xiù ēn ài de qíng lǚ nǐ yě kě yǐ shuō nǐ liǎ tài ròu má le wǒ dōu qǐ jī pí gē da le",
      "english": "If you hear someone sing, you can say: “Her singing voice gives me goose bumps all over.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "If you see two lovers showing affection, you can say: “You two are too icky, it’s giving me goose bumps.” …"
    },
